      "side": 1,
      "message": "This class should not be written to depend on behavior of the Tethering state machine; it should be valid for Tethering to remove all downstreams, then add back some, without notifying of changes in the upstreams.\n\nSee other comment about having IpServers register themselves to this class: in that case the IpServer can unregister when it exits BaseServingState maybe ?",
